    <briefdescription>
<para>Piecewise linear Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process class. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class describes the Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process governed by <formula id="141">\[ dx = a (level - x_t) dt + \sigma dW_t \]</formula></para><para><verbatim>   where the coefficients a and sigma are piecewise linear.</verbatim> </para>    </detaileddescription>
